<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>{{> layout/head-meta}}<title>로그인 | Busan Play</title></head>
<body>
{{> layout/header}}
<main class="login-gateway"><h1>부산의 경험을 이어가세요.</h1>
    <p>개인회원 또는 기업회원으로 로그인해주세요.</p><a href="/login">로그인 창 열기</a>
    <p><a href="/">메인으로 돌아가기</a></p>
    <noscript>
        <section><h2>개인회원 로그인</h2>
            <form action="/login" method="post"><label>이메일 <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username"
                                                                  required></label><label>비밀번호 <input name="password"
                                                                                                      type="password"
                                                                                                      autocomplete="current-password"
                                                                                                      required></label>
                <button type="submit">개인회원 로그인</button>
            </form>
        </section>
        <section><h2>기업회원 로그인</h2>
            <form action="/login/company" method="post"><label>이메일 <input name="email" type="email"
                                                                          autocomplete="username"
                                                                          required></label><label>비밀번호 <input
                    name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>
                <button type="submit">기업회원 로그인</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </noscript>
</main>
{{> layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>
